OL,3,ABritish rapper Yung Filly to face rape
OL,4,Aretrial in Australia next June
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish rapper Yung Filly will face a
OL,7,Frape retrial in Australia next June
OL,8,Fafter a jury failed to reach a verdict
OL,9,Fduring an earlier trial.
OL,11,FIn July, a jury acquitted the
OL,12,F31-year-old - whose real name is Andres
OL,13,FFelipe Valencia Barrientos - of three
OL,14,Fcounts of rape, one of assault and one
OL,15,Fof strangulation but found him guilty
OL,16,Fof two assault charges. No decision was
OL,17,Freached for three rape charges, which
OL,18,Fhe has denied.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
